  "releaseNotes": "Ollama speech now accepts a server root or /v1 API base and resolves the speech route automatically for complete and streaming requests. Existing complete and custom endpoint paths remain supported; proxy prefixes before /v1 and query strings are preserved. Updated C# samples, blog draft, documentation, and URL regression tests. Ollama speech still requires a supported Apple Silicon/MLX server; live speech generation and listening verification remain pending. Pipeline defaults are unchanged.",
